{"id":"vod_lz_90770","vodId":"90770","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士Z高达","name_cn":"机动战士Z高达","date":"1985-01-01","year":"1985","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20240705-1/aa55353f8be4916cab4a1f2d3ce599fa.jpg"},"summary":"故事舞台是在机动战士高达中的一年战争终结后七年。战争结束后一部份吉恩公国军事势力并未降伏继续在各地与地球联邦军发生军事冲突，因此地球联邦军内部强力主张追杀吉恩残余份子的激进排他势力泰坦斯（Titans）结成。由于泰坦斯对宇宙住民的强硬血腥镇压的手段，反势力奥干A.E.U.G.(台湾翻译为奥干，港译为奥古)结成。故事的开始于宇宙世纪0087年（U.C. 0087），前半主要围绕奥干和泰坦斯两派系的对抗，中段吉恩残余份子上阿克西斯(港译为阿古捷斯)登场，与奥干、泰坦斯角力周周旋，展开激战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-07-05 22:44:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38770_85202438/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38772_b97f0f04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38774_df56e6b1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38776_9bf4e1bc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38778_3be0a163/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38775_efaa50fd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38780_9e3728c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38777_92290ce7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38779_d3efb299/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38781_a984a5e2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38782_6e94a2df/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38783_01587597/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38785_855e9e6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38786_63ad4ab1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240704/38787_e5385901/index.m3u8"},{"name":"